Mahōdara calls Kumbhakarṇa rude and ignorant of statecraft --- Mahōdara says Rāvaṇa knows gain loss and place time division --- Mahōdara warns none can wake sleeping Rāma like death and fire --- Mahōdara says slayer of Janasthāna hosts cannot be beaten alone --- Mahōdara bids five men proclaim sortie and fight with effort --- Mahōdara bids them return bloodied claiming Rāma Lakṣmaṇa devoured --- Mahōdara bids city proclaim Rāma slain and king feast troops --- Mahōdara says despairing Sītā will yield learning husband lost